Nix: the package tree is in the read-only store and the server's requirements
(Python 3.12, numpy, Pillow, duckdb, fsspec) come from the derivation's Python,
so keep install.py's state in the user's state directory, make the mod copy
writable (a read-only source's modes are otherwise preserved), and skip the pip
venv when BEAMNG_EARTH_SYSTEM_PYTHON is set (the wrappers set it).

